"""Neon Presentation V3 engine: text -> layout -> image geometry -> images -> PPTX.

This engine is intentionally independent from the legacy Presentation engine.
It uses the uploaded V3 PowerPoint template as the only visual source of truth.
There is no fallback to the old engine.
"""
